        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/164cf0ae0d7db0a56fc1957aaab1a512-SNOT (5).png",
        "key": "csaif-pl-hardware-troubleshoot-panels-L6-CSandDev_-rev_v2_2026-dev-1bf0d6de-b003-4460-b91e-04a88b79f2d8"
      }
    ],
